SETNAM               = $ffbd ; KERNAL jump table: Sets the file name. Used: called 4.
OPEN                 = $ffc0 ; KERNAL jump table: Opens a logical file. Used: jumped to 2.
CLOSE                = $ffc3 ; KERNAL jump table: Closes a logical file. Used: jumped to 1.
CHKIN                = $ffc6 ; KERNAL jump table: Selects a file as the input channel. Used: called 1.
CLRCHN               = $ffcc ; KERNAL jump table: Restores the default I/O channels. Used: called 2.
CHRIN                = $ffcf ; KERNAL jump table: Reads a character from the input channel. Used: called 2.
STOP                 = $ffe1 ; KERNAL jump table: Tests the STOP key. Used: called 2.
GETIN                = $ffe4 ; KERNAL jump table: Reads a character from the keyboard buffer or the input channel. Used: called 2.
CLALL                = $ffe7 ; KERNAL jump table: Closes all files. Used: called 3.
UDTIM                = $ffea ; KERNAL jump table: Increments the jiffy clock. Used: called 1.
